PS5 VRR: switch like a PC, no setup and no black screen when VRR is toggled  [ps5-bazzite-deck v1.8.1]

On a PC, switching VRR on or off is immediate. Here it re-ran the whole HDMI setup and then
switched the chip over in five steps 250 ms apart, behind a muted picture: about 2 s of
black screen, which Steam's menus triggered often.
 - toggling VRR without a mode set only switches the chip: on, the FreeSync SPD and the
   follow block; off, the normal values (as the setup writes them) and the SPD switched off
 - the follow block in one block write, as the stock system writes its VSync block in one
   message, 100 ms after the GPU starts sending its timing packet
 - a mode set still runs the setup, with the picture muted until the chip has switched
